// Read from the inventory: Epomeduos's list of Avaricum's households.
@speaker Wax tablet of names
=== start
[quest factor none] ~ quest factor rumor
One leaf of wax, written close in Greek letters. You can't make out every word, but you can read numbers, and you know some of the names: they're painted over doors in the forum.

A household on each line. Beside it, heads: a man, a wife, two boys, a girl, an old woman. Beside that, a price in Roman coin. The house of Senodonnos the magistrate is near the top, and priced high. At the bottom, in the same patient hand, a total, if the city is taken entire.

It's a list of everyone in Avaricum, and what they'd fetch.
* Put it away. -> END
